OL,3,ASpotify uploads lyrics for Dolly
OL,4,AParton's Welsh version of Jolene in
OL,5,AIrish
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe lyrics to Dolly Parton's Welsh
OL,8,Fversion of her hit Jolene were uploaded
OL,9,Fmistakenly to Spotify in Irish.
OL,11,FThe song was recorded before her death
OL,12,Fon 25 August, and is a collaboration
OL,13,Fwith Welsh singer-songwriter Bronwen
OL,14,FLewis as well as Parton's niece, Jada
OL,15,FStar.
OL,17,FThe version has parts of the song sung
OL,18,Fin English and Welsh - but the lyrics
OL,19,Fpresented on the digital audio
OL,20,Fstreaming service Spotify actually
OL,21,Fshowed the language as Irish.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
